# ---- death scene ----
# Six lines per cause. The scene picks one at random and holds it for that death.
uky.death.prompt=Press any key or click to return
uky.death.promptLeave=Press any key to leave

uky.death.generic.1=Signal lost. Nothing claimed the kill.
uky.death.generic.2=You stopped. The world did not.
uky.death.generic.3=No cause recorded. Same result.
uky.death.generic.4=The run ends here unless you move.
uky.death.generic.5=Silence, then whatever you do next.
uky.death.generic.6=Get up. Nothing is watching.

uky.death.fall.1=The ground was always going to win.
uky.death.fall.2=You fell the whole way down.
uky.death.fall.3=Terminal velocity, terminal result.
uky.death.fall.4=Nothing hit you. You hit it.
uky.death.fall.5=Height is not the problem. Landing is.
uky.death.fall.6=Gravity kept its side of the deal.

uky.death.fire.1=You went out before the fire did.
uky.death.fire.2=Heat does not negotiate.
uky.death.fire.3=Ash now. Something else in a minute.
uky.death.fire.4=It burned through everything you were carrying.
uky.death.fire.5=You were the fuel. It ran out.
uky.death.fire.6=Nothing left to catch.

uky.death.drown.1=The air ran out first.
uky.death.drown.2=You stopped fighting the water.
uky.death.drown.3=Down here nothing is in a hurry.
uky.death.drown.4=The surface was closer than it looked.
uky.death.drown.5=Lungs empty. Everything else follows.
uky.death.drown.6=The water did not have to try.

uky.death.explosion.1=Everything arrived at once.
uky.death.explosion.2=The blast finished before you heard it.
uky.death.explosion.3=You were closer than the plan allowed.
uky.death.explosion.4=Pieces first, silence after.
uky.death.explosion.5=It did not aim. It did not have to.
uky.death.explosion.6=One second of noise, then this.

uky.death.void.1=There was no bottom. There never is.
uky.death.void.2=You fell out of the world.
uky.death.void.3=Nothing down there wanted you.
uky.death.void.4=The map ended. You kept going.
uky.death.void.5=No ground, no sound, no cause.
uky.death.void.6=You are not the first to miss the edge.

uky.death.mob.1=Something took its time with you.
uky.death.mob.2=It was faster. That is all.
uky.death.mob.3=You were counted, not fought.
uky.death.mob.4=It is still there.
uky.death.mob.5=The hit landed. Nothing else did.
uky.death.mob.6=You gave it the last opening.

# Server list status. 1.7.10 has no multiplayer.status.* keys of its own -- those
# arrived in 1.8 -- and the pinger's own wording is hardcoded English, so the words
# a player reads when a server will not answer have to come from here.
uky.server.status.pinging=Asking the server...
uky.server.status.unresolved=Address not found
uky.server.status.unreachable=No connection
uky.server.status.timedOut=No answer

uky.welcome.title=Welcome
uky.welcome.body=This pack replaces Minecraft's menus. Everything here can be changed later, in Settings.
uky.welcome.quality=How hard should the menu work?
uky.welcome.settings=All settings...
uky.welcome.start=Start
uky.graphics.potato.hint=No black hole. The backdrop is a flat colour and the menus keep everything else.
uky.graphics.minimal.hint=The hole is traced small and slowly. For weak or old cards.
uky.graphics.balanced.hint=Full resolution, no supersampling. Hard to tell from maximum in motion.
uky.graphics.maximum.hint=No ceiling. Everything is drawn as configured.

